sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client form
    participant S as Server Action
    participant DB as Database
    participant K as Next cache
    C->>S: POST (action ID + FormData)
    Note over S: authenticate + authorize
    Note over S: validate input (zod)
    S->>DB: mutate
    S->>K: updateTag / revalidatePath
    S-->>C: result + fresh RSC payload
    Note over C: UI updates in same round trip
